  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-mediumpurple pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Health Drain</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/01/Ikameijin.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20131031035504\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ikameijin\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/01/Ikameijin.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20131031035504\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/01/Ikameijin.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20131031035504 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/01/Ikameijin.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20131031035504 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Ikameijin\" width=\"270\" height=\"384\" data-image-key=\"Ikameijin.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Ikameijin.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Ikameijin (Kaiju Combat) can use his tentacle arms to drain power/health from opponents.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Drain health from others</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>drain physical health from others</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Health_Manipulation\" title=\"Health Manipulation\">Health Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Draining\" title=\"Vampiric Draining\">Vampiric Draining</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHealth_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can drain health from other targets and add it to the user's own, allowing them to heal one's wounds or cure their own sickness with the stolen health.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHealth_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Manipulation\" title=\"Biological Manipulation\">Biological Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Manipulation\" title=\"Body Manipulation\">Body Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">Death Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Health_Manipulation\" title=\"Health Manipulation\">Health Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Transferal\" title=\"Life-Force Transferal\">Life-Force Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Draining\" title=\"Vampiric Draining\">Vampiric Draining</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHealth_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Health drain affects anything in its path - may cause damage to allies.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHealth_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Trolls (<i>Age of Mythology</i>); gain HP equal to the damage they inflict.</li>\n<li>Hadrosaurids (<i>Dinosaur King</i>); via Emerald Garden</li>\n<li>Butterflamon (<i>Digimon</i>)</li>\n<li>Sylph (<i>Final Fantasy IV</i>)</li>\n<li>Ikameijin (<i>Kaiju Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>Shang Tsung (<i>Mortal Kombat</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://fireemblemwiki.org/wiki/Nosferatu\">Nosferatu</a> (<i>Fire Emblem</i>)\n<ul><li>Robin</li></ul></li>\n<li>Soldier (<i>Team Fortress 2</i>); via Concheror Buff</li>\n<li>Various Pokémon (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Various Characters (<i>Shin Megami Tensei</i>)\n<ul><li>Demi-Fiend (SMT III)</li>\n<li>Flynn (SMT IV)</li>\n<li>Nanashi (SMT IVA)</li>\n<li>Nahobino (SMT V)</li>\n<li>Abel (Devil Survivor 1)</li>\n<li>Hibiki (Devil Survivor 2)</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://questism.fandom.com/wiki/Yun_Jo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:questism:Yun Jo\">Yun Jo</a> (<i>QUESTISM</i>)</li>\n<li>Darth Malak (<i>Star Wars</i>)</li>\n<li>Darth Nihilus (<i>Star Wars</i>)</li>\n<li>Blood Death Knights (<i>Warcraft</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHealth_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"e047d811614e52abe2ae455bd7667ad8\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nosferatu2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nosferatu2.png\" title=\"Nosferatu2.png (2.49 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e2/Nosferatu2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20151120080825\" title=\"Nosferatu2.png (2.49 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Robin (Fire Emblem/Super Smash